From 3c1285831611fa2b149ee03e1244c39dcff4fb46 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 05:08:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Tool Result Relay for the real content_blocks shape

A live debug log showed the Agent message's content_blocks is
[ToolContent, TextContent]: the tool call sits directly in the list,
not inside a ContentBlock wrapper. The extractor only looked inside
wrappers, so nothing was ever relayed.

- Walk content_blocks recursively so both shapes are found
- Unwrap tool outputs recorded as structured data (dict with 'text',
  JSON or Python-repr strings) while leaving plain stories untouched
- Add tests using the real flat shape and structured outputs
- Note in CHANGELOG/DEVELOPER-DIARY
